    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/extras/f8e4c5e85b9978195e8d489781e38ca6.avif?t=1752842049\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INFORMATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble Investor is an investment game where you manage a bubble company and your goal is to achieve the highest return from them without the bubble bursting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/extras/f8e4c5e85b9978195e8d489781e38ca6.avif?t=1752842049\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your money in bubbles and withdraw it before they burst.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get benefits and buy more bubbles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff to help you with tasks such as Economists to get discounts at the store, Analysts who will help you approximately discover the breaking point of a bubble, Lawyers who will get you insurance to recover part of the money when the bubble bursts, etc...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/extras/f8e4c5e85b9978195e8d489781e38ca6.avif?t=1752842049\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your online company and subcontract friends to help you build an empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off in the market against rival companies and prove who is the best.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU READY TO BUILD AN EMPIRE?</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/extras/f8e4c5e85b9978195e8d489781e38ca6.avif?t=1752842049\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INFORMATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble Investor is an investment game where you manage a bubble company and your goal is to achieve the highest return from them without the bubble bursting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/extras/f8e4c5e85b9978195e8d489781e38ca6.avif?t=1752842049\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your money in bubbles and withdraw it before they burst.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get benefits and buy more bubbles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff to help you with tasks such as Economists to get discounts at the store, Analysts who will help you approximately discover the breaking point of a bubble, Lawyers who will get you insurance to recover part of the money when the bubble bursts, etc...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839840/extras/f8e4c5e85b9978195e8d489781e38ca6.avif?t=1752842049\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your online company and subcontract friends to help you build an empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off in the market against rival companies and prove who is the best.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU READY TO BUILD AN EMPIRE?</h2>",
